## What You Cannot Do

You may not:

* Sell SimpleDAW or require payment specifically to obtain or use it without my permission.
* Claim SimpleDAW, its original code, assets, or other original material as your own work.
* Remove or alter the copyright, attribution, license, or other notices included with SimpleDAW.
* Distribute modified or derivative versions of SimpleDAW without my permission.
