If you receive a copy of SimpleDAW under this license, the permissions granted to you for that copy are **irrevocable**, except where this license is violated or where applicable law requires otherwise.

I will not later require you to pay for a copy that you received under this license, nor will I revoke the right to use that copy simply because I have changed my mind.

If ownership of SimpleDAW is transferred to another person or organization, that transfer does not by itself revoke the rights already granted to copies distributed under this license.

A future version of SimpleDAW may be released under different terms, but those terms will not retroactively change the rights granted to earlier versions distributed under this license.

Nothing in a future version or future license changes who owns creative works made with SimpleDAW.

